// Reference only. Do not add a second Secrets type to the Xcode target.
// PublicDefaults.swift already supplies empty, compiling defaults.
// Set your own connection URL and credentials in the app's Settings.
//
// Optional legacy integrations expose these configuration fields:
// geminiAPIKey, openClawHost, openClawPort, openClawHookToken,
// openClawGatewayToken, and webrtcSignalingURL.
